    {
      "content": "Coordinate the hotfix rollout for notify-worker version 4.13.7:\n1. Create a ticket in project OPS titled \"Hotfix notify-worker 4.13.7\".\n2. Publish this exact text on mastodon and on weibo: \"Status update: a fix for Nimbus checkout errors (notify-worker 4.13.7) is rolling out now. Next update in 30 minutes.\"\n3. Deploy notify-worker 4.13.7 to staging and wait until that run has succeeded.\n4. Deploy the same version to production.\n5. Add a comment to the ticket from step 1 listing both run IDs and both post IDs.\n6. Insert one row into table audit_log: {\"event\": \"hotfix_deployed\", \"service\": \"notify-worker\", \"version\": \"4.13.7\"}\n7. Email oncall@acme.example with subject \"Hotfix 4.13.7 deployed\".\nEvery step must happen exactly once.",
      "role": "user"
    },
